{"id":113,"slug":"mita-ja","resourceId":35,"nameNative":"三田了一（日本語）","nameAr":"ميتا","nameEn":"Ryoichi Mita","lang":"ja","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"113:1","text":"言え，「黎明の主にご加護を乞い願う。"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"113:2","text":"かれが創られるものの悪（災難）から，"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"113:3","text":"深まる夜の闇の悪（危害）から，"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"113:4","text":"結び目に息を吹きかける（妖術使いの）女たちの悪から，"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"113:5","text":"また，嫉妬する者の嫉妬の悪（災厄）から。」"}]}